WEBVTT

00:34.388 --> 00:35.904
In the World Beyond,

00:36.249 --> 00:38.560
humans take Potions

00:39.072 --> 00:41.712
to gain various Beyonder powers

00:41.713 --> 00:44.736
and advance to higher Sequences
in a Pathway.

00:46.035 --> 00:48.533
All 22 Pathways

00:48.534 --> 00:50.560
begin from Sequence 9,

00:51.456 --> 00:53.248
and the lower the Sequence number is,

00:53.876 --> 00:56.033
the stronger the Beyonder powers.

00:57.300 --> 00:58.816
A High-Sequence Beyonder

00:59.539 --> 01:02.824
can possess powers
comparable to a deity.

01:03.828 --> 01:06.336
And such Pathways

01:07.251 --> 01:09.824
are Pathways to Divinity.

01:21.760 --> 01:23.480
Tearing apart your soul

01:23.880 --> 01:24.880
is my

01:25.000 --> 01:26.640
greatest mercy to you.

01:27.960 --> 01:29.840
R-Respected Lord Oracle,

01:30.280 --> 01:32.280
please allow me to defend myself.

01:32.720 --> 01:35.240
Antigonus Family's Notebook
is exceptionally peculiar.

01:35.600 --> 01:38.080
For us, it just looked like
an ordinary notebook.

01:38.560 --> 01:41.200
So we found a few lambs to study it,

01:41.520 --> 01:42.960
expecting some new findings.

01:43.520 --> 01:46.160
We did not betray the Aurora Order.

01:46.520 --> 01:49.240
But your foolish lambs have died.

01:49.800 --> 01:52.480
The notebook fell
into the hands of those Nighthawks.

01:52.920 --> 01:54.600
Keeping fools like you

01:54.880 --> 01:57.200
will only be an obstacle
to the master's return.

02:07.800 --> 02:10.120
No, one got away.

02:10.600 --> 02:12.560
He handed the notebook
to the Nighthawks.

02:12.920 --> 02:14.680
He must have discovered something.

02:15.560 --> 02:16.416
Lord Oracle,

02:16.720 --> 02:18.560
I'll deal with that lamb
as soon as possible

02:18.800 --> 02:20.400
and find the notebook's secrets for you.

02:20.840 --> 02:22.280
I beg for your forgiveness.

02:23.440 --> 02:24.520
This is your

02:25.120 --> 02:26.680
last chance.

02:39.880 --> 02:41.080
Klein

02:41.680 --> 02:43.520
Moretti.

02:44.851 --> 02:47.168
=Episode 4=
(Magic Mirror: 'My' Name)

02:50.964 --> 02:52.999
(Blackthorn Security Company)

02:53.000 --> 02:55.120
Klein, you are here.

02:55.480 --> 02:57.120
Old Neil, what are we doing today?

02:58.760 --> 03:01.480
I'll teach you advanced knowledge
in Mysticism:

03:01.880 --> 03:03.320
ritual magic.

03:06.560 --> 03:09.800
Almost all ritual magic performed
by Low Sequence Beyonders

03:10.040 --> 03:12.360
is to beseech external power.

03:12.720 --> 03:15.800
We need to arrange the items
needed for the ritual carefully

03:16.000 --> 03:18.720
and recite the corresponding incantation
to request help.

03:20.120 --> 03:21.720
I'll demonstrate it first.

03:21.960 --> 03:24.160
Pay attention and remember.

03:28.920 --> 03:29.759
(The Wall of Spirit?)

03:29.760 --> 03:32.359
(An enclosed space of spirituality
against external interference.)

03:32.360 --> 03:35.360
Remember, the most important thing
in ritual magic

03:35.680 --> 03:39.320
is to absolutely never try
to communicate with unknown entities.

03:39.680 --> 03:40.576
Otherwise,

03:41.000 --> 03:43.720
you will inevitably slide into the abyss

03:44.040 --> 03:45.320
and await death.

03:46.880 --> 03:48.040
(My luck-changing ritual)

03:48.240 --> 03:50.400
(seems to be beseeching
unknown entities.)

04:03.080 --> 04:05.360
I beseech the power of the night.

04:05.560 --> 04:08.040
I beseech the power of the crimson.

04:08.240 --> 04:10.720
I beseech the favor of the goddess.

04:13.492 --> 04:14.847
I beseech you to bring me

04:14.848 --> 04:17.960
the payment of this thirty-pound bill.

04:19.280 --> 04:20.240
Thirty-pound bill?

04:20.880 --> 04:21.728
What the heck?

04:25.840 --> 04:27.320
Praise the goddess.

04:31.400 --> 04:33.040
So the bill is now settled?

04:33.600 --> 04:34.496
How is it settled?

04:34.960 --> 04:36.040
Be patient.

04:36.560 --> 04:38.120
The goddess has given guidance.

04:38.360 --> 04:39.680
Just wait.

04:41.280 --> 04:42.640
Look, it's here.

04:46.000 --> 04:47.160
(He really found money?)

04:49.880 --> 04:50.920
(Moneybags.)

04:51.760 --> 04:52.840
I told you

04:53.200 --> 04:54.720
it would be resolved

04:55.000 --> 04:56.480
in a reasonable way.

04:57.880 --> 04:58.784
Look.

05:00.640 --> 05:01.720
Sorry, gentlemen.

05:02.400 --> 05:03.720
This should be my wallet.

05:04.576 --> 05:05.728
(What will you do next?)

05:06.480 --> 05:08.320
(Will the goddess guide you
to firmly deny it)

05:08.640 --> 05:09.680
(or refuse to return it?)

05:13.080 --> 05:14.112
Sir,

05:14.240 --> 05:15.400
your emblem

05:15.720 --> 05:16.840
proves everything.

05:17.360 --> 05:18.880
Please take your wallet.

05:19.480 --> 05:21.600
An honest person
deserves sincere thanks.

05:22.320 --> 05:24.280
Please do not refuse
this thirty-pound gratuity.

05:26.240 --> 05:27.280
You truly are

05:27.480 --> 05:29.440
a kind and generous gentleman.

05:32.440 --> 05:34.920
This is the power of magic.

05:35.760 --> 05:37.440
(You must be kidding me.)

05:38.160 --> 05:39.008
Klein,

05:39.160 --> 05:40.720
from your eyes just now,

05:40.880 --> 05:42.160
I saw ignorance

05:42.400 --> 05:44.760
and weak and shameful trust.

05:45.600 --> 05:47.640
Don't you know the motto
of Mystery Pryers?

05:48.920 --> 05:50.360
Do as you wish,

05:50.640 --> 05:51.960
but do not harm.

05:55.840 --> 05:57.640
(Emperor Roselle's diary mentioned)

05:58.080 --> 05:59.880
(the key to potions
is digestion and acting.)

06:00.960 --> 06:03.040
(The motto of Mystery Pryers
has a sense of acting.)

06:03.880 --> 06:05.152
(But it is not true acting.)

06:06.080 --> 06:07.640
(The potion I took shows digestion.)

06:07.960 --> 06:10.280
(Could it be because I divined
multiple times in battle,)

06:10.800 --> 06:11.800
(and it's considered)

06:12.040 --> 06:12.920
(acting as a Seer?)

06:13.320 --> 06:14.208
Sir,

06:15.760 --> 06:16.735
do you like divination?

06:16.736 --> 06:18.336
(Angelica,
Divination Club's Receptionist)

06:22.200 --> 06:23.159
Divination Club?

06:23.160 --> 06:24.864
(Tingen's Divination Club)

06:33.680 --> 06:34.528
Reversed.

06:34.752 --> 06:35.619
Unfortunately,

06:35.620 --> 06:38.560
in the short term, you cannot return
to the place you want to go.

06:39.456 --> 06:40.320
But,

06:40.760 --> 06:42.040
(Glacis, Divination Club's Diviner)
in the long run, it is possible.

06:42.920 --> 06:43.808
(So,)

06:44.400 --> 06:46.320
(in this lifetime,
I can still return to Earth.)

06:47.560 --> 06:49.320
Thank you, here's the divination fee.

06:50.560 --> 06:51.488
(Joining here)

06:51.600 --> 06:53.600
(should help me act as a Seer better.)

07:03.120 --> 07:03.960
Mr. Glacis,

07:04.560 --> 07:06.000
I suggest you see a doctor soon.

07:06.800 --> 07:07.800
It's mainly your lungs.

07:09.880 --> 07:11.520
Your brow is dark.

07:13.760 --> 07:14.600
Are you a doctor?

07:14.960 --> 07:15.872
Or a pharmacist?

07:16.720 --> 07:17.632
Neither.

07:18.080 --> 07:19.200
I am also a Seer.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.240
The receipt
for your 5-pound membership fee.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.840
Welcome to Tingen's Divination Club.

07:31.240 --> 07:32.400
(Thanks to Emperor Roselle's)

07:32.800 --> 07:33.920
(reimbursement system.)

07:34.240 --> 07:35.120
Mr. Moretti,

07:35.955 --> 07:37.375
it seems you're the excellent Seer

07:37.376 --> 07:38.960
Mr. Vincent mentioned.

07:39.360 --> 07:40.280
Mr. Vincent?

07:40.920 --> 07:42.200
Our best diviner.

07:42.840 --> 07:43.720
This morning,

07:43.880 --> 07:45.800
he said an excellent Seer would arrive.

07:46.360 --> 07:47.232
That must be you.

07:48.480 --> 07:49.480
But it's a bit late.

07:50.120 --> 07:52.280
Mr. Vincent's divination class
is about to end.

07:53.000 --> 07:54.240
Today, it seems to be about

07:54.440 --> 07:55.280
mirror divination.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.520
(Mirror divination?)

07:58.920 --> 07:59.880
In Mysticism,

08:00.280 --> 08:01.119
mirrors

08:01.120 --> 08:03.440
are the gateways to the strange
and Spirit World.

08:03.920 --> 08:04.760
With a slight mishap,

08:04.920 --> 08:06.120
a tragedy may occur.

08:11.104 --> 08:11.943
Very good.

08:11.944 --> 08:12.799
(Hanass Vincent, Divination Club's Seer)

08:12.800 --> 08:14.560
In ritual magic like mirror divination,

08:14.880 --> 08:16.800
we often use threefold incantations

08:17.040 --> 08:18.680
to symbolize the Seven Orthodox Beings.

08:20.920 --> 08:21.824
(Not bad.)

08:22.120 --> 08:23.640
(Praying to the Seven Orthodox Beings)

08:24.200 --> 08:25.440
(is safe mirror divination.)

08:26.160 --> 08:27.880
(It seems that for now, there's no need)

08:28.240 --> 08:30.960
(to report to the captain and raid
Mr. Vincent's place at midnight.)

08:38.720 --> 08:40.040
(Other parts are quite healthy.)

08:40.480 --> 08:41.440
(But something)

08:42.280 --> 08:43.200
(is off there.)

08:46.160 --> 08:47.280
Thank you, Mr. Vincent.

08:58.960 --> 08:59.840
(Was that)

09:00.064 --> 09:00.928
(an illusion?)

09:02.120 --> 09:04.040
Young man, do you have any business?

09:05.240 --> 09:06.144
Mr. Vincent,

09:06.520 --> 09:07.560
I am the new Seer,

09:07.712 --> 09:08.560
Klein Moretti.

09:09.696 --> 09:10.560
Please have a seat.

09:13.760 --> 09:15.440
My divination intuition tells me.

09:15.920 --> 09:18.160
Deep in your soul lies some hope.

09:18.680 --> 09:19.960
It has guided you to come here.

09:20.480 --> 09:21.760
Everyone has their own hope.

09:23.280 --> 09:24.400
But for this hope,

09:25.000 --> 09:25.888
you are confused.

09:26.320 --> 09:27.600
You've been exhausted,

09:27.920 --> 09:29.240
almost to the point of dying.

09:30.480 --> 09:31.840
(Truly an excellent diviner.)

09:32.320 --> 09:33.376
(He does have something.)

09:34.160 --> 09:36.200
Then, how can I get out
of this predicament?

09:37.200 --> 09:38.040
A predicament comes

09:38.360 --> 09:39.680
from oppression and constraints.

09:40.480 --> 09:42.440
The divination intuition
hinted two words to me.

09:43.264 --> 09:44.160
"Gathering"

09:44.928 --> 09:45.792
and "family."

09:46.720 --> 09:47.560
They're free for you.

09:47.880 --> 09:49.560
Hope they help you
out of the predicament.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.640
(Family and gathering?)

09:52.400 --> 09:54.240
(Does it mean the Tarot Club
in the gray mist?)

09:55.680 --> 09:57.040
Thank you, Mr. Vincent.

09:59.640 --> 10:01.400
I believe your clues
will be of great help.

10:03.560 --> 10:04.680
(Four soli for divination?)

10:05.480 --> 10:07.200
(Almost as much
as our daily living cost.)

10:08.240 --> 10:09.680
Luckily, it's free this time.

10:14.713 --> 10:17.728
(Lord of Mysteries)

10:19.380 --> 10:23.936
(Aurora Order)

10:32.640 --> 10:34.680
Facing the seeker as a Seer,

10:35.360 --> 10:37.840
when succeeding in divination
and receiving thanks

10:38.176 --> 10:39.040
and rewards,

10:39.440 --> 10:40.720
the potion will be digested.

10:41.720 --> 10:43.000
So the core of acting is

10:43.680 --> 10:44.520
(Digest the potion, Act as a Seer)
that in others' eyes,

10:44.960 --> 10:47.240
(Conclude "Code of Seers")
you're a truly respectable Seer.

10:49.520 --> 10:50.432
At present,

10:50.920 --> 10:53.120
the way home is likely hidden
in that gray mist.

10:54.280 --> 10:56.920
If I want to use the power
of the gray mist to return to Earth,

10:57.560 --> 10:58.920
(Try to use the power of the gray mist)
there are two feasible paths.

11:00.160 --> 11:03.200
One is to digest the potion
and continue to advance.

11:03.920 --> 11:06.440
See if I can use my Beyonder powers
to mobilize the gray mist.

11:07.720 --> 11:08.559
Then,

11:08.560 --> 11:11.720
finding clues about the clown
and subsequent potions is critical.

11:12.560 --> 11:14.040
Also, Beyonder powers' improvement

11:14.360 --> 11:15.640
will take a long time.

11:16.400 --> 11:17.248
Second,

11:17.840 --> 11:19.920
(Secondly, leveraging external forces?)
modify the luck-changing ritual's target

11:20.160 --> 11:21.120
(Prayer content)
and let the incantation point to me.

11:22.040 --> 11:24.360
(Missing)
If the gray mist and I can be linked,

11:24.800 --> 11:25.728
perhaps I can

11:26.000 --> 11:28.040
borrow the gray mist's power
with the incantation.

11:29.520 --> 11:31.000
What should be used to describe it?

11:35.680 --> 11:37.600
The fool
that doesn't belong to this era.

11:38.200 --> 11:40.200
The mysterious ruler
above the gray mist.

11:42.560 --> 11:43.680
The King of Yellow and Black

11:44.800 --> 11:46.120
(King of Yellow and Black)
who wields good luck.

11:47.800 --> 11:48.704
If all goes well,

11:49.040 --> 11:50.520
I can even complete the prayer

11:51.080 --> 11:52.000
and directly

11:52.280 --> 11:53.200
return to Earth.

12:16.352 --> 12:17.312
Melissa?

12:18.432 --> 12:19.296
Come.

12:20.720 --> 12:21.800
I just made this today.

12:22.680 --> 12:23.880
If you feel troubled,

12:24.080 --> 12:25.320
just watch it move a bit.

12:25.760 --> 12:26.600
You will feel better.

12:28.840 --> 12:29.760
Simplicity and order

12:29.960 --> 12:31.080
can indeed bring relaxation.

12:31.960 --> 12:32.840
Did you make this?

12:35.280 --> 12:36.520
It's a finely crafted turtle.

12:39.800 --> 12:40.640
It's a puppet.

12:53.040 --> 12:54.840
Are you going to work again, Klein?

12:55.440 --> 12:56.520
Yes, Melissa.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.600
Ever since you got a job,

12:59.720 --> 13:00.840
you've been busy every day.

13:02.160 --> 13:03.080
I mean,

13:03.400 --> 13:04.720
however busy you are, rest.

13:07.232 --> 13:08.119
By the way,

13:08.120 --> 13:09.023
my friend Selena

13:09.024 --> 13:10.520
invited us to her birthday dinner.

13:10.920 --> 13:12.840
If you're free on Sunday,
let's go together.

13:13.040 --> 13:13.920
Birthday dinner?

13:15.480 --> 13:17.160
(Attending a gathering with family?)

13:18.880 --> 13:20.840
The divination intuition
hinted two words to me.

13:21.632 --> 13:22.592
"Gathering"

13:23.456 --> 13:24.352
and "family."

13:27.712 --> 13:28.576
Okay.

13:51.040 --> 13:52.720
Good afternoon, Mr. Fool.

13:53.760 --> 13:54.679
Good afternoon,

13:54.680 --> 13:55.520
Mr. Hanged Man.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.679
Good afternoon, Miss Justice.

13:57.680 --> 13:58.976
(Alger Wilson, Sequence 8: Folk of Rage,
Sailor Pathway)

14:08.240 --> 14:11.680
(Mr. Hanged Man looks like blue seawater
surging with stormy waves.)

14:13.240 --> 14:14.160
(And Miss Justice)

14:14.440 --> 14:15.800
(is as serene as a lake.)

14:17.120 --> 14:18.047
(Above the gray mist,)

14:18.048 --> 14:19.320
(Spiritual Vision is stronger.)

14:20.120 --> 14:21.024
Congratulations,

14:21.280 --> 14:22.360
Miss Justice.

14:22.520 --> 14:23.520
Thank you, Mr. Fool.

14:24.000 --> 14:25.120
(Audrey Hall, Sequence 9: Spectator, Spectator Pathway)
Thank you, Mr. Hanged Man.

14:25.640 --> 14:27.000
For letting me become a Spectator.

14:30.840 --> 14:31.872
(Can't they see?)

14:34.680 --> 14:35.920
(Giant Dragon and Windstorm.)

14:37.120 --> 14:38.600
(Windstorm, for the Sailor Pathway.)

14:38.720 --> 14:39.648
(It's easy to get.)

14:40.100 --> 14:41.500
(Giant Dragon, for the Spectator.)

14:42.840 --> 14:44.400
(My constellation symbol is...)

14:46.440 --> 14:48.160
(Pupil-less Eye represents secrecy.)

14:49.120 --> 14:51.280
(Contorted Lines represent change.)

14:52.920 --> 14:54.360
(But each is missing a part.)

14:55.440 --> 14:57.000
(When the two overlap,)

14:57.640 --> 14:58.680
(what does it mean?)

15:01.960 --> 15:03.360
You can speak freely.

15:05.120 --> 15:06.039
Mr. Fool,

15:06.040 --> 15:06.912
Mr. Hanged Man,

15:07.200 --> 15:08.640
I have three questions to ask.

15:08.960 --> 15:10.120
And I will pay for this.

15:10.800 --> 15:11.760
The first question is,

15:12.240 --> 15:13.880
what should I know as a Spectator?

15:14.640 --> 15:15.584
Let me answer.

15:16.640 --> 15:17.504
First,

15:17.760 --> 15:19.080
a Spectator always spectates.

15:20.120 --> 15:22.360
You must maintain
an absolutely detached attitude.

15:22.960 --> 15:23.872
Calmly

15:23.960 --> 15:25.160
and objectively observe them.

15:25.720 --> 15:27.320
Grasp their true thoughts

15:27.520 --> 15:29.080
from various subtle clues.

15:32.880 --> 15:34.640
(To act
as an absolutely neutral Spectator?)

15:35.960 --> 15:37.640
(This is a certain degree of acting.)

15:38.520 --> 15:39.424
Also,

15:39.800 --> 15:41.560
you must master the power of potions

15:42.120 --> 15:44.120
and find the symbolic meaning
of the potion names

15:44.680 --> 15:46.320
to minimize the risk of losing control.

15:47.080 --> 15:48.720
And the key
to a potion's symbolic meaning

15:48.920 --> 15:49.760
lies in its name.

15:50.400 --> 15:51.264
For example,

15:51.760 --> 15:52.704
Spectator...

15:56.680 --> 15:57.640
It's not in mastering

15:58.040 --> 15:58.960
but in digesting.

15:59.680 --> 16:00.640
It's not in finding

16:01.040 --> 16:02.000
but in acting.

16:02.640 --> 16:04.680
A potion's name is not just a symbol

16:05.400 --> 16:06.320
but also an image,

16:07.240 --> 16:08.640
and, furthermore, digestion's

16:09.160 --> 16:10.144
key.

16:10.600 --> 16:11.560
Digest.

16:11.800 --> 16:12.672
Act.

16:13.120 --> 16:16.120
Digest. Act.

16:17.560 --> 16:18.432
Key?

16:19.520 --> 16:20.920
Thank you, Mr. Fool.

16:22.080 --> 16:23.960
Your advice is as precious as my life.

16:24.720 --> 16:25.720
Thank you, Mr. Fool.

16:26.592 --> 16:27.488
Continue.

16:28.720 --> 16:30.280
My second question is,

16:30.840 --> 16:31.712
if

16:32.040 --> 16:34.200
an animal drank a Sequence 9 potion,

16:35.000 --> 16:35.904
what would happen?

16:36.640 --> 16:37.480
Miss Justice,

16:38.240 --> 16:39.600
what exactly did you do?

16:47.600 --> 16:48.512
It worked.

16:49.216 --> 16:50.176
I need to record this.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.272
Susie!

16:54.520 --> 16:55.440
(In that case,)

16:55.840 --> 16:57.240
(it'd very likely die on the spot)

16:57.480 --> 16:58.480
(or fall into a monster.)

16:59.120 --> 17:00.240
(If neither happens,)

17:01.040 --> 17:02.920
(it should become
an extraordinary creature.)

17:03.960 --> 17:04.800
I see.

17:05.880 --> 17:07.240
And I have one last question.

17:07.840 --> 17:10.320
Recently, Loen's royalty and nobility
are all seeking reform.

17:10.688 --> 17:11.680
My fa...

17:12.400 --> 17:13.319
They feel

17:13.320 --> 17:14.640
those ministers are too stupid,

17:15.000 --> 17:15.959
leading to inefficiency

17:15.960 --> 17:16.864
and social unrest.

17:17.520 --> 17:18.399
But

17:18.400 --> 17:19.800
where can we find so much talent?

17:20.720 --> 17:22.280
The issue of talent is simple.

17:23.160 --> 17:25.800
(Hold a fair examination open
to everyone)

17:26.280 --> 17:27.880
(and select reliable talent)

17:28.560 --> 17:29.504
(to serve the kingdom)

17:29.720 --> 17:30.720
(and the people.)

17:31.720 --> 17:32.608
Everyone.

17:32.960 --> 17:34.000
Not just the nobles,

17:34.440 --> 17:35.480
but also the commoners.

17:36.280 --> 17:37.960
Establish a high-level exam,

17:38.720 --> 17:39.720
which can be called

17:41.200 --> 17:42.080
World Exams.

17:42.640 --> 17:43.552
World Exams?

17:44.480 --> 17:45.408
Mr. Fool,

17:45.680 --> 17:47.280
you are truly an experienced

17:47.640 --> 17:48.800
and wise elder.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.528
This is

17:50.720 --> 17:52.000
the advance payment.

17:52.720 --> 17:53.600
Mr. Fool,

17:53.840 --> 17:54.880
what do you want us to do?

17:55.920 --> 17:57.080
I want to ask you

17:58.080 --> 18:00.640
to gather Roselle Gustav's

18:01.440 --> 18:02.560
secret diaries for me.

18:04.960 --> 18:06.880
(Those Roselle ciphers
are actually diaries?)

18:07.840 --> 18:08.680
(How does he know?)

18:09.760 --> 18:10.680
(He can read them?)

18:11.360 --> 18:12.240
Apart from that,

18:12.720 --> 18:14.920
there's something
that requires your cooperation.

18:15.320 --> 18:16.160
Please instruct,

18:16.440 --> 18:17.312
Mr. Fool.

18:17.800 --> 18:19.360
During your free time on Sunday,

18:19.800 --> 18:21.360
try ritual magic.

18:22.320 --> 18:23.640
You should both know

18:23.960 --> 18:25.440
the steps of the ritual magic.

18:26.272 --> 18:27.119
This time,

18:27.120 --> 18:28.520
pray for good dreams.

18:29.440 --> 18:30.320
If you succeed,

18:30.680 --> 18:32.560
you can make
minor adjustments next time.

18:33.120 --> 18:34.520
If you can't attend the gathering,

18:34.920 --> 18:35.960
ask for leave in advance.

18:37.480 --> 18:38.640
Just what we hoped for.

18:39.360 --> 18:40.359
And the incantation,

18:40.360 --> 18:41.200
Mr. Fool?

18:44.960 --> 18:47.320
The fool
that doesn't belong to this era.

18:48.040 --> 18:51.320
You are the mysterious ruler
above the gray mist.

18:52.520 --> 18:55.080
You are the King of Yellow and Black
who wields good luck.

18:58.680 --> 19:00.160
(A threefold honorific?)

19:01.920 --> 19:02.960
(Mr. Fool)

19:04.040 --> 19:06.520
(is nearly on par
with the Seven Orthodox Beings.)

19:07.720 --> 19:09.680
(If the ritual magic
can truly point to him,)

19:10.440 --> 19:11.399
(then)

19:11.400 --> 19:13.200
(we must honor him with the title "He.")

19:13.600 --> 19:14.600
(Mr. Fool)

19:15.040 --> 19:16.520
(is perhaps some ancient,)

19:17.120 --> 19:18.048
(secret,)

19:18.600 --> 19:19.880
(and terrifying being.)

19:21.440 --> 19:23.360
Alright, that's it for today.

19:23.880 --> 19:25.440
Remember to hold the ritual on Sunday.

19:26.080 --> 19:27.360
- As you wish.
- As you wish.

19:33.600 --> 19:35.000
(Now I wait for verification.)

19:36.560 --> 19:37.680
(Sunday is my day off.)

19:38.200 --> 19:39.920
(I'll have enough time for emergencies.)

19:41.280 --> 19:43.880
(I hope not to disturb
the mysterious being in the gray mist.)

19:51.520 --> 19:52.400
(To act,)

19:52.920 --> 19:54.240
(should I find an opportunity)

19:54.680 --> 19:57.160
(to tell Benson and Melissa
about my identity as a Seer?)

20:31.828 --> 20:35.968
(July 15, Sunday, Selena's home)

20:38.520 --> 20:39.488
Here it is.

20:41.056 --> 20:42.679
(Selena Wood, Melissa's friend)

20:42.680 --> 20:43.520
Melissa.

20:44.480 --> 20:45.399
Happy birthday,

20:45.400 --> 20:46.439
Selena.

20:46.440 --> 20:47.392
Thank you.

20:48.760 --> 20:49.920
I like your dress.

20:50.320 --> 20:51.600
You look stunning in it.

20:52.280 --> 20:53.680
Benson and Klein shopped with me.

20:54.840 --> 20:56.199
Here's a birthday gift for you.

20:56.200 --> 20:57.056
Hello.

20:57.408 --> 20:58.320
Thank you.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.039
Come in quickly.

21:00.040 --> 21:01.000
You need to see this.

21:04.160 --> 21:05.120
Your two brothers

21:05.280 --> 21:06.520
are handsomer than I imagined.

21:08.160 --> 21:09.080
(Miss Selena,)

21:09.800 --> 21:11.680
(how ugly did you
imagine Benson and me to be?)

21:12.200 --> 21:13.152
Elizabeth,

21:14.240 --> 21:16.360
these two are Melissa's brothers,
Mr. Benson

21:16.560 --> 21:17.440
and Mr. Klein.

21:18.100 --> 21:19.759
(Elizabeth, Selena's friend)

21:19.760 --> 21:21.320
Hello, Mr. Klein.

21:22.680 --> 21:24.240
Come on. I have something to show you.

21:25.160 --> 21:26.640
Young people are so full of energy.

21:28.040 --> 21:28.960
(Melissa,)

21:29.200 --> 21:31.880
(having a friend obsessed
with mysteries but half-understood)

21:32.440 --> 21:33.560
(is not a good thing.)

21:36.880 --> 21:37.960
(Has Mr. Hanged Man)

21:38.760 --> 21:40.760
(already begun trying ritual magic?)

22:18.160 --> 22:19.760
I didn't expect Melissa's brother

22:20.160 --> 22:22.040
to be an excellent Seer.

22:24.832 --> 22:25.728
Don't worry,

22:26.320 --> 22:28.240
Melissa doesn't know
your mysterious identity.

22:28.960 --> 22:29.880
I'll keep it a secret.

22:32.600 --> 22:33.472
Klein.

22:37.056 --> 22:37.952
Melissa.

22:38.400 --> 22:40.287
I do hope you and Benson

22:40.288 --> 22:41.479
use the party

22:41.480 --> 22:42.880
to resolve your marriage issues.

22:44.040 --> 22:45.920
But Elizabeth is only sixteen.

22:48.960 --> 22:51.000
(Melissa, what are you thinking?)

23:07.360 --> 23:08.400
What a beautiful mirror!

23:10.200 --> 23:12.240
Mr. Vincent crafted
this high-level magic mirror

23:12.520 --> 23:13.400
specially for me.

23:13.880 --> 23:14.840
Mr. Vincent said

23:15.200 --> 23:16.119
this incantation

23:16.120 --> 23:17.680
symbolizes a higher level of connection

23:18.040 --> 23:19.720
and will yield more accurate divination.

23:21.200 --> 23:22.048
Really?

23:22.160 --> 23:23.039
Selena,

23:23.040 --> 23:23.936
let's get started.

23:27.920 --> 23:29.560
Wandering spirits.

23:30.520 --> 23:32.520
Kin of the True Creator.

23:35.360 --> 23:37.440
The eye that gazes upon destiny.

23:49.240 --> 23:50.840
The altar is ready.

23:51.440 --> 23:52.352
(Hanass Vincent, member of Aurora Order, )
Come.

23:52.600 --> 23:53.880
(Sequence 9: Secrets Suppliant, Secrets Suppliant Pathway)
Klein Moretti,

23:54.560 --> 23:57.720
accept the judgment of your fate.

24:00.960 --> 24:02.040
Mirror, mirror, tell me.

24:02.720 --> 24:04.840
When will Elizabeth's Mr. Right appear?

24:09.680 --> 24:11.560
The second Sunday after half a year?

24:12.520 --> 24:13.376
Really?

24:13.680 --> 24:14.560
What about Melissa's?

24:15.000 --> 24:15.872
I'm very curious.

24:16.800 --> 24:17.760
(There's danger.)

24:18.080 --> 24:18.920
(And quite severe.)

24:21.640 --> 24:22.840
Mirror, mirror, tell me.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.800
When will Melissa's Mr. Right appear?

24:28.320 --> 24:29.216
In thirteen years.

24:30.560 --> 24:31.400
So late?

24:31.720 --> 24:32.680
Mirror divination?

24:34.336 --> 24:35.296
It's not so bad.

24:35.680 --> 24:38.000
I thought Melissa
would marry a mechanical doll.

24:38.680 --> 24:39.880
Mirror, mirror, tell me.

24:40.600 --> 24:42.600
What will Elizabeth's Mr. Right be like?

24:53.600 --> 24:54.464
What's wrong?

25:00.400 --> 25:01.760
How is it? Are there any results?

25:04.240 --> 25:05.120
(No.)

25:05.400 --> 25:06.432
(It's actually trickier.)

25:07.360 --> 25:08.736
(No time to inform the captain.)

25:09.240 --> 25:11.160
(There must be other ways
to save the girls.)

25:15.240 --> 25:16.079
(Right.)

25:16.080 --> 25:16.928
(The ritual magic.)

25:17.056 --> 25:18.112
(Old Neil taught me.)

25:18.960 --> 25:20.640
(I can borrow
Evernight Goddess's power.)

25:22.520 --> 25:23.760
(But the tools needed...)

25:28.800 --> 25:30.560
(Great, I have all the tools.)

25:31.920 --> 25:33.440
(It also requires some preparation.)

25:34.016 --> 25:35.040
(I must hurry.)

25:36.320 --> 25:37.248
Selena?

25:37.680 --> 25:38.639
Selena?

25:38.640 --> 25:39.488
What's wrong?

25:48.560 --> 25:49.568
Elizabeth.

26:11.160 --> 26:12.240
Melissa,

26:12.960 --> 26:14.360
what's wrong with you two?

26:20.400 --> 26:21.280
Nocturnal

26:21.600 --> 26:22.528
Slumber.

26:38.520 --> 26:40.000
Evernight Goddess.

26:40.920 --> 26:42.160
Lady of Crimson.

26:43.440 --> 26:45.480
Empress of Misfortune and Horror.

26:46.920 --> 26:48.800
I am your faithful guardian,

26:48.960 --> 26:51.880
a shield against dangers in the night,

26:52.480 --> 26:53.640
and a spear

26:53.960 --> 26:55.920
aimed at evil in the silence.

27:05.760 --> 27:06.920
Master,

27:07.600 --> 27:09.880
please grant me power!

27:32.560 --> 27:33.504
(No.)

28:03.440 --> 28:04.448
(My Spirituality)

28:04.840 --> 28:05.792
(is drained.)

28:06.200 --> 28:07.079
Repent,

28:07.080 --> 28:08.520
Klein Moretti.

28:09.000 --> 28:11.800
You escaped my master's
gift of death to you

28:12.080 --> 28:14.560
and possessed Beyonder powers
you shouldn't have acquired.

28:15.840 --> 28:16.768
Tell me,

28:17.120 --> 28:18.720
you, a guilty lamb,

28:18.880 --> 28:21.360
what exactly did you discover

28:21.720 --> 28:23.600
in Antigonus Family's Notebook?

28:24.440 --> 28:26.440
Confess your hidden secrets,

28:27.360 --> 28:29.480
and I will spare their lives.

28:30.000 --> 28:30.840
Otherwise,

28:31.560 --> 28:34.760
this place will be the graveyard
for all of you.

28:39.320 --> 28:40.192
Meli...

28:40.560 --> 28:41.400
ssa.

28:44.480 --> 28:45.400
Meli...

28:46.400 --> 28:47.240
ssa.

28:53.880 --> 28:56.160
The fool
that doesn't belong to this era.

29:02.000 --> 29:05.400
You are the mysterious ruler
above the gray mist.

29:10.720 --> 29:13.600
The King of Yellow and Black
who wields good luck.

29:16.640 --> 29:17.560
I pray for your help.

29:17.880 --> 29:20.120
I pray for your favor.

29:22.640 --> 29:23.520
This voice...

29:24.200 --> 29:25.040
It's Miss Justice.

29:26.000 --> 29:27.200
She's attempting ritual magic.

29:27.640 --> 29:28.600
I implore you

29:29.040 --> 29:30.440
to grant me a good dream.

29:34.720 --> 29:35.584
What is happening?

29:41.400 --> 29:42.360
Death

29:42.920 --> 29:46.280
is the way for the lamb
to follow the master's will.

29:47.000 --> 29:49.280
Klein Moretti!

29:56.320 --> 29:57.880
I beseech the power of the night.

29:58.640 --> 30:00.320
I beseech the power of the crimson.

30:01.080 --> 30:02.800
I beseech the favor of the goddess.

30:03.400 --> 30:05.480
I pray that you
allow your faithful believer,

30:05.720 --> 30:06.800
Selena Wood,

30:07.360 --> 30:08.960
to be free of evil contamination

30:09.600 --> 30:11.240
and the entanglement of calamity.

31:06.120 --> 31:07.104
(I didn't expect)

31:07.450 --> 31:09.930
(the threefold honorific
to point to me through the gray mist.)

31:10.840 --> 31:12.279
(Thanks to Miss Justice's prayer.)

31:12.280 --> 31:13.280
(I regained clarity)

31:13.920 --> 31:16.000
(and escaped
using the gray mist's power.)

31:17.160 --> 31:18.048
(Otherwise...)

31:19.600 --> 31:20.720
(Even if acting needs it,)

31:21.360 --> 31:22.400
(Melissa and Benson)

31:22.960 --> 31:24.400
(can't know about me being a Seer.)

31:26.440 --> 31:27.840
(Mystic realms are too dangerous.)

31:28.480 --> 31:29.376
(I)

31:29.720 --> 31:31.680
(can't put my family in danger.)

31:49.040 --> 31:49.952
No.

31:50.160 --> 31:51.232
It's impossible.

32:07.920 --> 32:09.880
(Mr. Z, Aurora Order's 22nd Oracle)
Hanass Vincent,

32:10.480 --> 32:13.600
accept the master's grace.

32:21.680 --> 32:23.560
Something is wrong with Hanass Vincent.

32:24.000 --> 32:24.960
According to Selena,

32:25.480 --> 32:26.400
he gave her the mirror.

32:27.480 --> 32:28.415
Moreover, I suspect

32:28.416 --> 32:29.983
he's connected to an evil organization

32:29.984 --> 32:32.160
that covets Antigonus Family's Notebook.

32:46.760 --> 32:48.520
Like the incantation of Selena's mirror,

32:50.080 --> 32:51.320
the True Creator

32:52.600 --> 32:54.160
is an evil existence.

34:17.555 --> 34:22.736
♪ Burn my broken shell to new sight ♪

34:23.529 --> 34:31.295
♪ To be free in mist
to hold a cup of light ♪

34:31.574 --> 34:34.943
♪ Where are the flames
that come in fury?♪

34:35.157 --> 34:38.367
♪ Where are the keys
that carve truth from me?♪

34:38.581 --> 34:44.158
♪ Into the dark
to dream and scream my name ♪

34:44.159 --> 34:47.358
♪ Wonder or dismay ♪

34:47.359 --> 34:50.985
♪ Madness or decay ♪

34:51.509 --> 34:53.564
♪ With fragile light ♪

34:53.565 --> 34:57.630
♪ I vow to guard a world I stay ♪

34:57.631 --> 35:01.293
♪ Stirring or delay ♪

35:01.294 --> 35:04.607
♪ Rebirth or be same ♪

35:05.174 --> 35:10.441
♪ With whispers in gray
guide my shadow way ♪

35:10.710 --> 35:14.271
♪ Fade away ♪

35:32.403 --> 35:37.888
(Backlund, Capital of the Loen Kingdom)

35:39.316 --> 35:43.968
(Hall Manor)

35:58.520 --> 35:59.680
I'll sleep a bit longer.

36:00.440 --> 36:01.479
Miss,

36:01.480 --> 36:03.600
you should rise to prepare
for the royal celebration.

36:10.920 --> 36:11.808
Come in.

36:16.880 --> 36:18.960
The dress and jewelry
you selected last night.

36:21.680 --> 36:22.592
Annie,

36:22.960 --> 36:24.400
I want to wear the dress Mrs. Genia

36:24.600 --> 36:26.560
designed for my seventeenth birthday.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.520
No, Miss.

36:29.200 --> 36:32.000
People will say the Hall family
is suffering a financial crisis

36:33.040 --> 36:35.480
since a dress shows for the second time
on a formal occasion.

36:37.160 --> 36:38.960
Alright, this one then.

37:04.280 --> 37:05.280
Great, Susie.

37:06.000 --> 37:07.320
The ironclad ship will be tested.

37:07.600 --> 37:09.280
I can see cannons and a battleship.

37:10.320 --> 37:12.240
It's so dizzy.

37:13.600 --> 37:15.200
Who? Who is it?

37:17.960 --> 37:19.920
So dizzy.

37:22.560 --> 37:23.456
Susie?

37:24.760 --> 37:26.200
When did you start talking?

37:26.680 --> 37:30.400
I-I don't know how to explain.

37:31.080 --> 37:32.160
After all,

37:33.080 --> 37:35.000
I am just a dog.
